    <title>Verifying Agentic Tool Use with Formal Contracts:
  A Supply-Chain Perspective</title>
    <summary>  We study formal verification of tool-calling agents whose plug-ins arrive
through package registries. We model registries as adversarial supply chains
and derive contracts that bound the blast radius of a compromised dependency.
Contact: alice.example@university.edu
</summary>
